<title>RUSSIA: Three die in Russian oil refinery blast.</title>
<headline>Three die in Russian oil refinery blast.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three people were killed and four injured in an explosion on Thursday at an oil refinery in the Siberian region of Irkutsk, Itar-Tass news agency said.</p>
<p>The blast occurred in the morning at a refinery belonging to the Angarskaya petrochemical company, it said.</p>
<p>A special commission will start investigating the causes of the blast on Friday, Tass said.</p>
<p>There was no immediate word on how serious the damage was or how the explosion would affect local fuel supplies.</p>
</text>
